        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1303808",
      "subQuestName": "Prepare for the third bout",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "130380501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "130380501": {
            "id": "130380501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Duaenre",
            "text": "Thus ends the second bout. We will now move to the third bout. Duelists, please step forward.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380502"
            ]
          },
          "130380502": {
            "id": "130380502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "I'm ready.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380503"
            ]
          },
          "130380503": {
            "id": "130380503",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "So am I.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380504"
            ]
          },
          "130380504": {
            "id": "130380504",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Duaenre",
            "text": "This is the final stage of the rite. I remind you both that the terms you agreed upon in advance are binding.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380505"
            ]
          },
          "130380505": {
            "id": "130380505",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Duaenre",
            "text": "When you're both ready, you may begin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380506"
            ]
          },
          "130380506": {
            "id": "130380506",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380507"
            ]
          },
          "130380507": {
            "id": "130380507",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "I am Sethos, vessel of Hermanubis, grandson of Bamoun, the leader of the Temple of Silence.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380508"
            ]
          },
          "130380508": {
            "id": "130380508",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "For many years, we have kept our covenant with Lord Hermanubis by guarding the secrets of King Deshret. And even in our darkest hour, when we could not see a way forward, we chose not to abandon hope, but to embark on a brave new experiment so that we might prevail.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380509"
            ]
          },
          "130380509": {
            "id": "130380509",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "We earnestly sought Lord Hermanubis's wisdom and power, longing to see his spirit and his light descend upon us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380510"
            ]
          },
          "130380510": {
            "id": "130380510",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "Now, I will fight to become the rightful wielder of that power!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380511"
            ]
          },
          "130380511": {
            "id": "130380511",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "I am Cyno, General Mahamatra of the Akademiya, student and successor of Cyrus, the sage of Spantamad. I fight in defense of my power, my professor, and my nation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380512"
            ]
          },
          "130380512": {
            "id": "130380512",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "And you? I think you left some things unsaid. This is a sacred duel, and Hermanubis is watching. So bare your soul.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380513"
            ]
          },
          "130380513": {
            "id": "130380513",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380514"
            ]
          },
          "130380514": {
            "id": "130380514",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "(Everyone... old and young, fit and frail, they're all waiting to see how this duel will end.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380515"
            ]
          },
          "130380515": {
            "id": "130380515",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "My grandfather is a wise leader. He is also known to be a ruler who is not afraid to get blood on his hands. I understand his beliefs well, and I know what he expects of me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380516"
            ]
          },
          "130380516": {
            "id": "130380516",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "But our faith has held us back for too long. After I grew up, I went to the rainforest once, and I saw for myself the people of the city.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380517"
            ]
          },
          "130380517": {
            "id": "130380517",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "Times have changed. The people of Sumeru are happier and more free now than in the past. I thought about this as I stood at one of the tallest points in the city, gazing down at the streets below.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380518"
            ]
          },
          "130380518": {
            "id": "130380518",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "Then I thought of you, Cyno. You and I both wield the same power, yet the lives we lead could not be more different.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380519"
            ]
          },
          "130380519": {
            "id": "130380519",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "Each Ba Fragment of Hermanubis stands for something different — might, glory... or one of many other secrets that have yet to be revealed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380520"
            ]
          },
          "130380520": {
            "id": "130380520",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "I once thought that the nature of our fragments must be what makes us so different from one other. But... maybe, it's that you've found your answer, and I am still searching for mine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380521"
            ]
          },
          "130380521": {
            "id": "130380521",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "I am more than just a warrior. I am my own person.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380522"
            ]
          },
          "130380522": {
            "id": "130380522",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "...Exactly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380523"
            ]
          },
          "130380523": {
            "id": "130380523",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380524"
            ]
          },
          "130380524": {
            "id": "130380524",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "The name \"Hermanubis\" has left its mark on both of us, shaped the course of our lives. We are his vessels, and yet we are more besides.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380525"
            ]
          },
          "130380525": {
            "id": "130380525",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "So show me your answer, Cyno. Show me I can be more than my faith, more than the power I wield... Show me the person I can become!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380526"
            ]
          },
          "130380526": {
            "id": "130380526",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "Bring it on!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380527"
            ]
          },
          "130380527": {
            "id": "130380527",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How is it? Do you feel okay?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380528"
            ]
          },
          "130380528": {
            "id": "130380528",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130380529"
            ]
          },
          "130380529": {
            "id": "130380529",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1303851",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "130385101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "130385101": {
            "id": "130385101",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "I'm really looking forward to this Rite of Duels. It'll be one for the ages.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130385102"
            ]
          },
          "130385102": {
            "id": "130385102",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "Not just for the sake of the Ba Fragments, but for many other people as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130385103"
            ]
          },
          "130385103": {
            "id": "130385103",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "Grandfather..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1303899",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "130389901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "130389901": {
            "id": "130389901",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "(...Grandfather, you have to hold on.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130389902"
            ]
          },
          "130389902": {
            "id": "130389902",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Don't forget, safety first!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130389903"
            ]
          },
          "130389903": {
            "id": "130389903",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hey, you there! You better play nice with {M#him}{F#her}, or Paimon will make you regret it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130389904"
            ]
          },
          "130389904": {
            "id": "130389904",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sethos",
            "text": "Little bit too much chatter from the audience over there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130389905"
            ]
          },
          "130389905": {
            "id": "130389905",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Heyyy!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130389906"
            ]
          },
          "130389906": {
            "id": "130389906",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "Watch out!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130389907"
            ]
          },
          "130389907": {
            "id": "130389907",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Go, Tighnari, go!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130389908"
            ]
          },
          "130389908": {
            "id": "130389908",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "He drank plenty of water before the bout, so he should be fine..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}